semaphore-mcp-server for Debian

Configuration:
  Set SEMAPHORE_URL and SEMAPHORE_TOKEN environment variables, or create
  a .env file in the working directory.

  Example:
    export SEMAPHORE_URL=https://your-semaphore-instance.example.com
    export SEMAPHORE_TOKEN=your-api-token

Usage:
  semaphore-mcp

